  "question": "Can the Controller's installation token, narrowed to pull_requests: read on the canary alone, read a pull request's comments, GET /repos/{repo}/issues/{n}/comments, as the seen port reads them; and what is a token, narrowed to metadata: read alone, answered for the same read? (decision 0061)",
